# Wi-Fi Plaza door, no Nintendo WFC login.
#
# The B1F plaza attendant is at (4, 4). VAR_VISITED_POKEMON_CENTER_B1F
# skips the Pal Pad give so the first A is the door, not the tutorial.
# The script walks through and warps to WIFI_PLAZA_ENTRANCE; ScrCmd_2F7
# is a no-op without a DWC profile, which is why the lobby's PPW traps
# never fire. The assertion is that door, not that the plaza works.

name PLAZAR
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
var VAR_VISITED_POKEMON_CENTER_B1F 1
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY_POKECENTER_B1F 4 5 FACE_UP
